'''Ariden's Camp''' is a campsite found just north of the main road passing through [[Deadwind Pass]] from [[Duskwood]] to the [[Swamp of Sorrows]]. It is occupied by [[Magus Ariden Dusktower]] of the [[Kirin Tor]], who is investigating the growing magical energies surrounding the tower of [[Karazhan]].

